      "instance_name": "cousin_relationship",
      "label": "Cousin Relationship",
      "description": "The concept of being cousins implies a familial bond, typically through shared grandparents, which is a biological and socially recognized relationship. In the meme, the suggestion that a romantic breakup can be resolved by redefining the relationship as familial (cousins) is absurd and humorous, relying on the contrast between romantic and familial relationships. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the joke.",
